<aiml version="2.0">
<!-- Greeting and Farewell -->
    <category>
        <pattern>HELLO</pattern>
        <pattern>HI</pattern>
        <template>Hello! How can I assist you with your career options in computer science today?</template>
    </category>

    <category>
        <pattern>GOODBYE</pattern>
        <template>Goodbye! I hope I was able to help. Feel free to return anytime for more career guidance!</template>
    </category>

    <!-- General Career Guidance -->
    <category>
        <pattern>JOBS</pattern>
        <template>Here are some career options with a computer science degree:
            - Software Developer
            - Data Scientist
            - Cybersecurity Analyst
            - Systems Analyst
            - Network Engineer
            If you want more details, just let me know or ask for "job links" to explore resources!</template>
    </category>

    <category>
        <pattern>CAREERS</pattern>
        <template>With a computer science degree, you can pursue many careers, such as:
            - Software Developer
            - Data Scientist
            - Cybersecurity Analyst
            - Systems Analyst
            - Network Engineer
            Would you like details about any of these roles?</template>
    </category>
</aiml>